WEBVTT

00:00:00.650 --> 00:00:07.611
Stairio HR Enterprise is a talent discovery workspace, designed for Stairio and corporate recruiting teams.

00:00:10.800 --> 00:00:13.637
Describe the people your team needs in plain English.

00:00:13.797 --> 00:00:17.261
The brief becomes filters, and the search finds matching people.

00:00:19.530 --> 00:00:22.531
Review and edit every filter the search understood.

00:00:23.370 --> 00:00:25.861
Green chips explain why each person matched.

00:00:26.450 --> 00:00:30.226
Change a filter to refine the results, without another model call.

00:00:34.790 --> 00:00:38.374
Profiles bring together experience, education and skills.

00:00:38.534 --> 00:00:41.947
Add promising people to a shortlist, then save the search.

00:00:44.790 --> 00:00:49.842
Save useful criteria, return to them later, and keep promising candidates together.

00:00:53.530 --> 00:00:56.726
When the data cannot answer a requirement, the search says so.

00:00:57.700 --> 00:01:00.124
It returns no matches instead of guessing.

00:01:01.580 --> 00:01:04.513
Remove that requirement to search the rest of the brief.

00:01:07.730 --> 00:01:10.542
Team handles everyday hiring for small companies.

00:01:10.800 --> 00:01:14.821
Enterprise supports talent discovery for larger recruiting teams.

00:01:14.981 --> 00:01:19.977
Both are designed for Stairio, with services tailored to each company's actual needs.
